---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping Policy | Great Gus Productions"
  description="Shipping information for merchandise orders from Great Gus Productions.">

<section class="legal-page">
<h1>Shipping Policy</h1>
<p class="last-updated">Last Updated: March 9, 2026</p>

<div class="legal-content">

<h2>Order Processing</h2>
<p>
All merchandise is produced on demand and fulfilled by our production partner,
Printful. Orders typically take 2–5 business days to be produced before they
are shipped.
</p>

<h2>Shipping Times</h2>
<p>
Once shipped, delivery times vary by destination. Domestic orders often arrive
within 5–10 business days, while international delivery can take longer based on
destination country, customs processing, and carrier conditions.
</p>

<h2>Shipping Rates</h2>
<p>
Shipping rates are calculated at checkout. Standard shipping is currently
$5.50 for the first item and $2.20 for each additional item within the same
order.
</p>

<h2>International Shipping</h2>
<p>
Printful ships merchandise orders worldwide, and our checkout now accepts shipping
addresses across Stripe-supported destinations.
</p>
<p>
For orders shipped outside the United States, customers may be responsible
for customs duties, import taxes, VAT, brokerage fees, or other charges imposed by the destination country.
Unless otherwise stated at checkout, these charges are not included in the purchase price or shipping total
and are the responsibility of the recipient.
</p>

<h2>Tracking</h2>
<p>
Once your order ships, you will receive a tracking number via email so you
can monitor delivery progress.
</p>

<h2>Shipping Issues</h2>
<p>
If your package is lost, delayed, or arrives damaged, please contact us so
we can assist in resolving the issue with the shipping carrier or fulfillment
partner.
</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>
If you have questions regarding shipping, order delivery, or merchandise issues,
please contact:
</p>

<p>
GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC<br />
Washington State<br />
<a href="mailto:greatgusproductions@gmail.com">
greatgusproductions@gmail.com
</a>
</p>

<h2>Copyright</h2>
<p>
© 2018–2026 GREAT GUS PRODUCTIONS LLC. All Rights Reserved.
</p>

</div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin-top: -2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    color: #bdbdbd;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .legal-content p,
  .legal-content li {
    color: #e6e6e6;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }
</style>